TENDL-2026 (TALYS Evaluated Nuclear Data Library)                 3025 1451   11
                                                                  3025 1451   12
Photon general purpose library                                    3025 1451   13
                                                                  3025 1451   14
Author: A.J. Koning, IAEA                                         3025 1451   15
                                                                  3025 1451   16
Ref.: A.J. Koning, D. Rochman, J.-Ch. Sublet, N. Dzysiuk,         3025 1451   17
      M. Fleming, and S. van der Marck, TENDL: Complete nuclear   3025 1451   18
      data library for innovative nuclear science and             3025 1451   19
